# Project KAI website — backend configuration (optional)
#
# The site works fully without these: every backend-dependent feature
# (comments, reactions, feature requests, bookmarks, admin moderation)
# runs in DEMO MODE when these are unset -- real UI, honest "not saved"
# messaging, zero fake persistence. See src/lib/supabase.js.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values to enable persistence.
# Both variables below are safe to expose in browser code by design:
# the anon key only ever grants what Row Level Security explicitly
# allows (see supabase/schema.sql) -- it is NOT the service-role key.
# The service-role key must NEVER be used in this website's code.

PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
